{"type":"message","id":"66167e7b","parentId":"8ac5882b","timestamp":"2026-03-16T04:33:32.721Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b544ccf7be4acb33503dfb7efb6d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-03-16 12:33 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b544ccf7be4acb33503dfb7efb6d]\n范: 为我安装 Capability Evolver 这个技能，并告诉我怎么使用"}],"timestamp":1773635612717}}
{"type":"message","id":"1cb6ef00","parentId":"66167e7b","timestamp":"2026-03-16T04:33:53.705Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户想要安装一个名为 \"Capability Evolver\" 的技能。根据政策，我需要：\n1. 先尝试用 `skillhub` 搜索和安装（中国优化版）\n2. 如果不可用或无匹配，再回退到 `clawhub`（公共注册表）\n3. 安装前要总结源、版本和风险信号\n\n让我先搜索这个技能。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"我来帮你查找并安装 Capability Evolver 技能。先搜索一下这个技能的信息。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ttn3e4pyk5331sh0iqthxfam","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"skillhub search Capability Evolver"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":19699,"output":114,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19813,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773635612719}}
{"type":"message","id":"2460a9be","parentId":"1cb6ef00","timestamp":"2026-03-16T04:33:54.683Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ttn3e4pyk5331sh0iqthxfam","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\ncapability-evolver  Capability Evolver\n  - A self-evolution engine for AI agents. Analyzes runtime history to identify improvements and applies protocol-constrained evolution.\n  - version: 1.29.5\ncapability-evolver-turbo  Capability Evolver Turbo\n  - Enhances capability evolution using 100+ AI models with cloud persistence, multi-model workflows, team sync, and cost analytics for efficient self-improvement.\n  - version: 1.0.1\nxquik-x-twitter  Xquik X/Twitter\n  - X API & Twitter automation skill. Build integrations with the Xquik REST API, MCP server & webhooks: tweet search, user lookup, follower extraction, engageme...\n  - version: 1.7.0\nwechat-tool  wechat-tool\n  - 通过微信查询好友、群聊及成员，确认目标后发送文本、图片或文件消息，实现社交管理与消息发送。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nvideo-narrator  Video Narrator\n  - Generate professional video narration with timing synchronization and style matching. Use when users need voiceovers, video narration, or documentary-style c...\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntweetclaw  TweetClaw\n  - OpenClaw plugin for X/Twitter automation. Post tweets, reply, like, retweet, follow, DM, search, extract data, run giveaways, monitor accounts via Xquik. 40+...\n  - version: 1.1.0\nsenserobot  SenseRobot元萝卜AI下棋机器人\n  - 用户可以让 OpenClaw 控制元萝卜下棋机器人进行围棋取落子、机械臂移动、表情控制、语音播报、棋盘管理时使用此技能。触发词包括\"元萝卜\"、\"下棋机器人\"、\"机械臂控制\"。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nresearch-analyzer  Research Analyzer\n  - 综合研究分析工具 - 整合多源搜索、学术文献、数据分析，一键生成研究报告 (Security Fixed)\n  - version: 1.0.1\nnvidia  Shop from Nvidia - With your claw and creditcard\n  - Buy at Nvidia | Manage compatible cards, wallets & payments. Financial management for Agents and OpenClaw bots.\n  - version: 1.0.0\nnostrwalletconnect  NostrWalletConnect\n  - Nostr Wallet Connect (NIP-47) SDK for AI agents — pay Lightning invoices, check balance, create invoices via any NWC-compatible wallet.\n  - version: 0.1.0\nmuapi-workflow-skill  Workflow\n  - Build, run, and visualize multi-step AI generation workflows. The AI architect translates natural language descriptions into connected node graphs — chain im...\n  - version: 0.1.0\nmuapi-ui-design-skill  Ui Design\n  - Generate high-fidelity UI/UX mockups for mobile and web apps using Atomic Design principles — creates wireframes and design systems via muapi.ai\n  - version: 0.1.0\nmuapi-photo-pack-skill  Photo Pack Generator\n  - Generate a pack of professional or aesthetic photos from a single reference image while preserving the exact identity of the person.\n  - version: 0.1.0\nmuapi-nano-banana-skill  Nano Banana\n  - Reasoning-driven image generation using structured creative briefs (Gemini 3 style) — generates high-fidelity images via muapi.ai with logic-based prompting\n  - version: 0.1.0\nmma-bridge  Meteor Master AI Bridge\n  - 通过 mma-bridge 命令行工具与 Meteor Master AI 交互\n  - version: 1.0.0\nkyaukyuai-linear-cli  Linear CLI\n  - Manage Linear issues from the command line using the linear cli. This skill allows automating linear management.\n  - version: 2.1.0\nk8s-debug  K8s Debug\n  - Diagnose and fix Kubernetes pods, CrashLoopBackOff, Pending, DNS, networking, storage, and rollout failures with kubectl.\n  - version: 0.1.0\nhk-cn-content-matrix  Hk Cn Content Matrix\n  - 香港/中文内容运营指南 - 小红书、抖音、微信公众号内容创作模板和策略。香港本地化，生活/理财/旅行/美妆赛道。\n  - version: 1.0.3\nfxai-skills  FXAI\n  - 创建 V5 代币（USDT/BNB 池子可选，0税或税收四档）；支持 USDT/BNB 买入，按数量或按比例卖出到 USDT/BNB。说「FXAI」触发。依赖 BNB Chain MCP，且 MCP env 中必须配置 PRIVATE_KEY。\n  - version: 1.0.1\nenv-secrets-rotator  Environment Secrets Rotator\n  - Rotate and update secrets in environment files, generate Vault commands, and manage secret rotation workflows.\n  - version: 1.0.0"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":974,"aggregated":"You can use \"skillhub install [skill]\" to install.\ncapability-evolver  Capability Evolver\n  - A self-evolution engine for AI agents. Analyzes runtime history to identify improvements and applies protocol-constrained evolution.\n  - version: 1.29.5\ncapability-evolver-turbo  Capability Evolver Turbo\n  - Enhances capability evolution using 100+ AI models with cloud persistence, multi-model workflows, team sync, and cost analytics for efficient self-improvement.\n  - version: 1.0.1\nxquik-x-twitter  Xquik X/Twitter\n  - X API & Twitter automation skill. Build integrations with the Xquik REST API, MCP server & webhooks: tweet search, user lookup, follower extraction, engageme...\n  - version: 1.7.0\nwechat-tool  wechat-tool\n  - 通过微信查询好友、群聊及成员，确认目标后发送文本、图片或文件消息，实现社交管理与消息发送。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nvideo-narrator  Video Narrator\n  - Generate professional video narration with timing synchronization and style matching. Use when users need voiceovers, video narration, or documentary-style c...\n  - version: 1.0.0\ntweetclaw  TweetClaw\n  - OpenClaw plugin for X/Twitter automation. Post tweets, reply, like, retweet, follow, DM, search, extract data, run giveaways, monitor accounts via Xquik. 40+...\n  - version: 1.1.0\nsenserobot  SenseRobot元萝卜AI下棋机器人\n  - 用户可以让 OpenClaw 控制元萝卜下棋机器人进行围棋取落子、机械臂移动、表情控制、语音播报、棋盘管理时使用此技能。触发词包括\"元萝卜\"、\"下棋机器人\"、\"机械臂控制\"。\n  - version: 1.0.0\nresearch-analyzer  Research Analyzer\n  - 综合研究分析工具 - 整合多源搜索、学术文献、数据分析，一键生成研究报告 (Security Fixed)\n  - version: 1.0.1\nnvidia  Shop from Nvidia - With your claw and creditcard\n  - Buy at Nvidia | Manage compatible cards, wallets & payments. Financial management for Agents and OpenClaw bots.\n  - version: 1.0.0\nnostrwalletconnect  NostrWalletConnect\n  - Nostr Wallet Connect (NIP-47) SDK for AI agents — pay Lightning invoices, check balance, create invoices via any NWC-compatible wallet.\n  - version: 0.1.0\nmuapi-workflow-skill  Workflow\n  - Build, run, and visualize multi-step AI generation workflows. The AI architect translates natura