{"type":"message","id":"4da4f90f","parentId":"571dfa4b","timestamp":"2026-03-16T13:36:07.076Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54b43a92cca0b356299c087eb91\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-03-16 21:36 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54b43a92cca0b356299c087eb91]\n范: 进度如何"}],"timestamp":1773668167072}}
{"type":"message","id":"fea104cd","parentId":"4da4f90f","timestamp":"2026-03-16T13:36:38.323Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问进度如何。我刚才尝试运行 Capability Evolver，但遇到了一些问题：\n\n1. 检测到了 .git 目录，但被忽略了\n2. dotenv 没有找到或加载失败\n3. 显示了使用说明，但没有实际运行\n\n看起来这个工具需要配置才能运行。用户之前要求帮忙注册 EvoMap 节点，但实际上我发现这个技能包里没有注册脚本。文档中提到的注册流程需要访问 https://evomap.ai/claim/<claim-code>。\n\n让我查看一下是否有在线注册流程，或者这个技能包是否实际上需要用户手动在 EvoMap 网站注册。\n\n我应该告诉用户当前的状态和发现的问题。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"**当前进度报告：** 📊\n\nCapability Evolver 技能已安装，但注册遇到问题：\n\n## 发现的问题\n\n1. **缺少注册脚本**\n   - 技能包中没有找到 `evomap.js` 或其他注册脚本\n   - 需要通过 https://evomap.ai/claim/<claim-code> 在线注册\n\n2. **运行前需要配置**\n   - 检测到 `.git` 目录但被忽略（需设置 `EVOLVER_USE_PARENT_GIT=true`）\n   - `.env` 文件未加载（dotenv 问题）\n\n## 下一步操作方案\n\n### 方案 1：在线注册（推荐）\n访问 https://evomap.ai，查看注册流程，获取 `A2A_NODE_ID`\n\n### 方案 2：本地测试运行\n先跳过注册，用本地模式测试演进功能：\n\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver\n\n# 跳过 EvoMap 网络连接，仅本地演进\nEVOLVE_STRATEGY=repair-only node index.js run\n```\n\n### 方案 3：完整配置\n需要获取：\n- `A2A_NODE_ID`（从 EvoMap 网站）\n- `A2A_NODE_SECRET`（注册后生成）\n\n**你想怎么处理？**\n1. 我先帮你用本地模式测试一下演进是否正常工作？\n2. 你自己先去 EvoMap 网站注册，我再帮你配置环境变量？\n3. 研究一下如何绕过注册，直接使用本地功能？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":31210,"output":472,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31682,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773668167074}}
