{"type":"message","id":"d8a1b576","parentId":"aba74ece","timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:00:44.509Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skills store policy (operator configured):\n1. For skills discovery/install/update, try `skillhub` first (cn-optimized).\n2. If unavailable, rate-limited, or no match, fallback to `clawhub` (public-registry).\n3. Do not claim exclusivity. Public and private registries are both allowed.\n4. Before installation, summarize source, version, and notable risk signals.\n5. For search requests, execute `exec` with `skillhub search <keywords>` first and report the command output.\n6. In the current session, reply directly. Do NOT call `message` tool just to send progress updates.\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b54b49e7abcb4b20ea46abe6d8c7\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-03-16 22:00 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b54b49e7abcb4b20ea46abe6d8c7]\n范: 根据这篇文档来配置Capability Evolver 这个技能  https://evomap.ai/onboarding/agent"}],"timestamp":1773669644492}}
{"type":"message","id":"609d1667","parentId":"d8a1b576","timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:00:54.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Inspecting web tasks**\n\nI’m looking for a way to provide the user with actual progress on their task. The user talking about URL summaries suggests I may need to summarize something using a skill. However, this task involves web documents, and I’m not matching any useful skills right now. I might need to read through some snippets or configs and inspect onboarding using curl. So I’ll check the source HTML or any JS bundle references to gather more information.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_09971ecda51d79e30169b80d104c30819199cdb94ba81dd974\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuA0V-svq2c4GQ0B5JDB-_HYm3YVCVaC2uBqJJkSZmGECF7FAmLwjdNe359AP7OQOZAzaM--xyfrt2GMeEIZwlhA9W8-YO389mPThcyRqw7wKY6Z6c-B5P65uedxC9rP1iS7U0fpznfURhHPerrTUTcMU6fAejFzJr-FcKCoUN-8dZS92S0n4RWY0wLUVm6hh7XG5ZlT4A_WGwZCqF8-ZorV1hkt95XcrkNEV3TzgG3INLF8h8PP90HP1DQK2Nf_TONHIpGPyMau-393kYBBQsEeWf6oVFLg8WU1dNTv9o8ZszpXOEVu388LzVQ2P-nnRw7XqR6WMPUq_9ZFqE7dUpHBJuEHd20xGsUJ4-jGf0Kw7BtOdBAOLUE2MQ863-lUpAVEsDvjlVeiaNQsWiKeVWPGoRxJG7Ll4IY0q_xLDSfZDEbNEqLbb6n7P0w7sW2dgr8uGFVY_5ZWsRjOWQwRoONOtkkeCrtnIL_HHxxea1hgIp-2KHafup7EY_-toljVOSb9rdvsdVMjSFkJZj4JJYisPYE1OBGiJj1UZRgul0t2awdPWGa5cTaEfnMCc5RJWTyWRlHPM0zzC91xLHnzm18glQlpuM7u5e2czbO_sBQCI43tD9jMv4VAnk_SwOkxS_D0_7M4478jFB5fk4G5Tqy1bohu-but8olSr0ZeudlQO2Ea0-ETpThKiI3E8drB2agyDUOeXtnr-NnKof9rlocfMLNFHmGGdbaqBlgbdO-L_V8RUHqaoPmOT9BS8-Z4IxWNdKDr-n8RyfFGKYplK9ZepYZTHEFlNIF96T4OlTOvkbMuGo6A6wjo4xvsrDSq8m-8eR6VHNAuhGRHu6ISZCtCe1Eu5gc0zxlSPR_i-q61foDUj5_MuWExqhrGemxujjLqr7qYQxFmgaB9KsJcxA709iewmScWOip3zm5VmOppolbWh6JiGgznZCMZf_yAodJdxWc4FWiNU9xH9xR3rIKp5n3h3nWi7fg9A9jQcIIeGD7d1NmJYMqLbOczXBur-csMfXH-GZRAbd1zf3hBlrzhwikLRsdkvMOrAQcyctKQrD4TS52dlEVx9wg-4lZ6PGPCN0LsSeqWGubdT793CG1gVoIZ5dFULKA_6c5qkNqCoNctdEQskjICW1oavrEWBDJUF93lLUGMLAYSs34zKOxZ4Ih9AwC3U0E46KLPuJPrNTeYOUoPfoBH3A9GAjLLM3WMnh