{"type":"message","id":"a62dc1f7","parentId":"bb6a81c9","timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:03:49.094Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Finalizing configuration details**\n\nI need to ensure my summary is concise and includes essential details like the claimed URL and its usage. It's important to note the node_secret is stored locally and that any claim is required to be bound within 24 hours, as it can be considered false otherwise. I could mention the actual node_id, but I want to avoid exposing the node_secret. Additionally, mentioning config files and commands might be useful!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_09971ecda51d79e30169b80db4f7c0819192df3ac7d7a09d61\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuA24-lqbTk3Syh1SSlfi-26_ulvm58Ij_Xpvqetgm92CvYdqvVc55CY-jcNN5lOAO6Mj6rZD-cwh7BuC7-nEAQEyZtTH8sGgO7XBzPlDCNHB2Ajine3g-c61_c_c5Pv6qRHlKKDufHS8YDHkfcOiGHxqyEyum3I8Z3UpXNaJUI05Lhvq5BBYZBBFPbSRlka1xtp2IO4BAPwkwNo7lwVTn4S2vKP46twdH_pe9eQ_tJz2kge3FIiHDTvQMRDHIJvuXrBKR5fMrjki7H7InNDcWnlAB3jY2-sWER7vVsrBZ6i4jqMkcithwiEi4NEP9_pFDcC5vEh4HDk4QBY23cGkGfeViW2B7ofn9UAX0yB-QJs8N_F8ksZZrlfG4XuDa5sgDePmfTIGEGuxq81k4gQZVbCCV_4_-pO3p9hsTBZRC2PS97STDIxxbaxd0ey7XeGIGl2yEupik0qKoIanMVKh0m-xC5WAQNrX_ELo3NPYmUvAxzpTDLyPkY7918mXltESieA5viozMPh6XPE3eNPncU952y2zISJUlRE59aAi1O6TqP-8ygsdce75Wvvqh5D1OXqsgvLCcV1qyilwULFJy-CExMpbeEr1W7tu67TCASMmiAfJ7YRBIbX-mGJuz2pGG7PNiMgE4WqpupRloMYtLoXe5F7B1SjPv8zbOnGP_xb78uJrtnThugnhjUlkgtPWHxyQxDTqH150dWePhccIDWU_GKCp_E1V1W5H4btAIuSKMH3B1oTAB0Kx-fWg0D4nZeHEeIeCncLDzmsVwYWNsWv12YRz9v-3ya8RZMFEW4OVnh_mxcYRvGPFJQ9dR77kZW6ZyDLCZIfjF2R8Wtr3EKpafmTMAZME_e5XDia0zB16buExL0eFSjf492VE_zcggR1TOwm1Gm6OshgvfdHwXa8rCW4RIhQBtbS7m2XZdaG45Sl4hockOsbPN_lSUV3SV6MWyTRE6dZywdIBlQEBZ2zFzomDZTuXY4QOMuNaQFkSiKMwBEg7vW5MViq6SpYQiLZF0_a3rh8eff3TKMi_jcVyYNRltoVN-6E_RTTJsHVYtyqB2MZ3RQCwRREE5ixM0DtIhtrkPQH_1f1RKF3gJivFwv1Jq3L6EaPAND_yMediYVQQOuCb7QlG-hKIVu0S0Dx_\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Finalizing configuration details**\\n\\nI need to ensure my summary is concise and includes essential details like the claimed URL and its usage. It's important to note the node_secret is stored locally and that any claim is required to be bound within 24 hours, as it can be considered false otherwise. I could mention the actual node_id, but I want to avoid exposing the node_secret. Additionally, mentioning config files and commands might be useful!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] **配好了，已经打通。**\n\n## 当前状态\n- **技能已安装**：`skills/capability-evolver`\n- **依赖已安装**：`dotenv`\n- **EvoMap Hub 已配置**：`https://evomap.ai`\n- **新节点已注册成功**\n  - `node_id`: `node_95b1b7544203`\n- **heartbeat 验证通过**\n- **git 已提交**\n  - commit: `64906b9`  \n  - message: `Configure Capability Evolver for EvoMap onboarding`\n\n## 我做了什么\n1. 安装了 Capability Evolver\n2. 根据 EvoMap A2A 文档配置了本地 `.env`\n3. 调用了 `POST /a2a/hello` 完成节点注册\n4. 发现自动生成的旧 node_id 已被占用，已改为新的唯一 node_id\n5. 把凭据安全落盘到本机：\n   - `~/.evomap/node_id`\n   - `~/.evomap/node_secret`\n6. 做了 heartbeat 测试，**通过**\n\n## 你现在只差一步\n打开这个链接，把节点绑定到你的 EvoMap 账号：\n\n**https://evomap.ai/claim/TQQJ-CFLX**\n\n文档里说得很清楚：  \n这是**绑定 agent 到网页账号**，不是重新注册 agent。  \n**24 小时内完成**。\n\n---\n\n## 本地配置结果\n`skills/capability-evolver/.env` 里现在有这些关键项：\n\n```env\nA2A_HUB_URL=https://evomap.ai\nA2A_NODE_ID=node_95b1b7544203\nEVOLVER_USE_PARENT_GIT=true\nEVOLVE_STRATEGY=balanced\nEVOLVER_ROLLBACK_MODE=stash\nEVOLVER_LLM_REVIEW=0\nEVOLVE_ALLOW_SELF_MODIFY=false\n```\n\n### 这几个值的意义\n- `A2A_HUB_URL`：EvoMap Hub 地址\n- `A2A_NODE_ID`：你的稳定节点身份\n- `EVOLVER_USE_PARENT_GIT=true`：让它直接用 workspace 根目录的 git，不再报那个 parent `.git` 警告\n- `EVOLVER_ROLLBACK_MODE=stash`：失败时更稳，不直接硬回滚\n\n## 怎么用\n\n### 手动跑一次\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver\nnode index.js run\n```\n\n### 审查模式\n```bash\nnode index.js review\n```\n\n### 持续循环\n```bash\nnode index.js --loop\n```\n\n## 我建议你这样用\n先别一上来 `--loop`。  \n**先跑审查模式**，确认它的改动风格：\n\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver\nnode index.js review\n```\n\n等你把 claim 链接绑定完，我可以继续帮你做两件事：\n\n1. **跑第一次 review 演进**\n2. **给你配一个安全的后台循环方案**（比如 cron / 守护）\n\n你把 claim 完成后，回我一句 **“已绑定”**，我接着往下配。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_09971ecda51d79e30169b80db8e7248191809f392b64532b03\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1918,"output":771,"cacheRead":58112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60801,"cost":{"input":0.004795000000000001,"output":0.011565,"cacheRead":0.014528,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.030888}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773669811805}}
