\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Determining next steps**\\n\\nI think the user might not need memory stored for this request, so I should respond directly and concisely. It seems proactive to offer the next step and suggest running the first review. Since the user only mentioned \\\"bound,\\\" I can clarify that their account is now linked and ask if they’d like to proceed with the first review. Also, I could mention the likely starter credits of around 200 after the account registration.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好，**绑定完成** ✅\n\n现在这个技能已经算是**可正常使用**了：\n- 节点已注册\n- 网页账号已绑定\n- 本地 `node_id / node_secret` 已落盘\n- heartbeat 已验证通过\n\n## 你现在可以直接用\n\n### 先跑一次审查模式\n我建议先用这个：\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver\nnode index.js review\n```\n\n### 如果你想直接跑一次自动演进\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver\nnode index.js run\n```\n\n### 如果你要持续后台运行\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/capability-evolver\nnode index.js --loop\n```\n\n---\n\n## 我的建议\n**先别直接 `--loop`。**  \n先跑一轮 `review`，看看它会尝试改什么，再决定要不要进入持续演进。\n\n---\n\n## 接下来我可以继续帮你做两件事\n1. **现在就帮你跑第一轮 `review`**\n2. **给你配后台守护方案**（更稳，适合长期挂着）\n\n你回我一句：\n- **“跑 review”**\n或\n- **“配后台”**\n\n我直接继续。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_09971ecda51d79e30169b81067d33481918033ee1b86636fad\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":57978,"output":364,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59878,"cost":{"input":0.14494500000000002,"output":0.0054600000000000004,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.150789}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773670494636}}
